Condition Expression (ET) :
-> Enter an expression to specify a routing condition. As long as the condition is true, the loop processing is executed.
   Example of XML conditions: /bank_name/bank_id = 'mybank', //BankId = 'ABC'
   Example of Non-XML conditions: ${header.SenderId} = '001'

Max Numbers of iteration (ET) :
-> Specify the maximum number of iterations the loop is to be executed. Even if the condition is still
   met, the loop ends afterwards.

Action when Max. Iterations Reached (DD) : (Throw Exception , End Loop)
-----------------------------------------
-> Select to throw an exception when the maximum number of iterations has been reached or to exit the
  loop and continue with the main process without error even if the looping condition continues to be true.

